大正 7. 3. 31</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="library-seal">
              <label>左半葉右上方朱色方篆</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">京都帝國大學圖書之印</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="donation-seal">
              <label>左半葉欄外右側長方朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">富士川游寄贈</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右半葉為封面之背，所見題字為透墨。左半葉起連續墨筆漢文，章與正文分層。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:None">
